  "decisions": [
    "Native button and anchor semantics, existing af-btn states and loaders are reused.",
    "Secondary Round L retains its 20 px icon and matching 20 px loader.",
    "Filled diamond and triangle SVG assets retain their original 33 px geometry, embedded in CSS; outline uses the original CSS geometry because the SVG export mask is invalid. Unordered text lists align left; ordered numbering is preserved.",
    "Web text retains full line height; Figma text-box-trim is not applied to body copy.",
    "Standard component letter spacing is zero. Page Display keeps the explicit 36 px mobile exception; fitted slide typography is unchanged."
  ],
